WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.497
Five stones hold jumps of 2, 3, 1, 1 and 4.

00:05.497 --> 00:08.309
Can you reach the end?

00:08.309 --> 00:14.700
Trying every route from every stone blows up fast.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.340
Forget the route.

00:18.340 --> 00:31.700
Track one number instead: the farthest stone you could reach so far.

00:32.000 --> 00:42.467
Stone 1 jumps 3, landing on stone 4 and stretching the reach to 4.

00:42.467 --> 00:47.700
Every later stone sits inside it.

00:48.000 --> 00:53.307
One scan, O(n) time: yes, you reach the end.

00:53.307 --> 00:59.700
That’s greedy: the best move now, never looking back.

